{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>HOW LONG CAN YOU SURVIVE?</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TowerBonk</strong> is a <strong>Survivor </strong>where you try to survive against waves of enemies! Blast incoming hordes, equip modules, level up, and upgrade your weapons to become an unstoppable tower of firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you hold out long enough to reach absurd levels of destruction?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>UPGRADE &amp; GO BONKERS</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy enemies, earn XP, and level up to unlock powerful upgrades! Each level gives you new weapons or modules to choose from, evolve your build to create crazy synergies. Every run is unique, every combo more chaotic than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4151450?t=1765818511","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4151450?t=1765818511","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151450/d3e74a0b451f53a6fb830d096f087267358f9f7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765818511","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4151450/d3e74a0b451f53a6fb830d096f087267358f9f7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765818511","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>HOW LONG CAN YOU SURVIVE?</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TowerBonk</strong> is a <strong>Survivor </strong>where you try to survive against waves of enemies! Blast incomi